  "goodToKnow": "Der Abschaum is scum, a strong insult for despised people: der Abschaum der Menschheit (the scum of the earth). Literally, it's the froth skimmed off a boiling liquid: beim Kochen den Abschaum abschöpfen. Der Schaum is foam: Badeschaum, Rasierschaum, Bierschaum. Using Abschaum about groups of people is seen as dehumanising and may even count as Volksverhetzung (incitement). It has no plural."
